; DCA_XAUUSD_v5 - Cau hinh theo chot thao luan 2026-10-27 (phan 1-9)
; Dung kem DCA_XAUUSD_v5.mq5, KHONG dung cho v1/v2/v3/v4 (v5 co them input time window + flip)
; Load in MT5 Strategy Tester > Inputs > Load
; LUU Y: day la cau hinh DE TEST, khong phai bao dam co loi.
; Cac diem chinh so voi v3/v4:
; - Chi chan moi lenh 1.5 lot, vuot qua thi tinh la 1.5 lot; bo chan tong, bo chan margin, bo chan tong hedge
; - Tia lai: tu xa nhat toi gan nhat, dong thoi nhieu lenh, moi lenh tia giu lai 10 USD (tuy chinh InpTrimMinNetProfit)
; - Bo chot lai rieng GH 100 USD; lai GH chi de tia; trailing uu tien hon chot tong 50 USD, trailing tiep tuc vuot 50 USD
; - GH dao thanh am rieng khi lo va di nguoc trung binh GH >=20 USD, co setup nhom rieng, cach A
; - Chot chan cuoi DD mac dinh 100% (tuy chinh), khong cooldown, bot chay lien tuc, co setup khung gio trong ngay
; - Chi tinh DDmax, khong dem so lan chot chan cuoi lam tieu chi code; cac muc danh gia do Thai tu danh gia sau backtest
; - Spacing DCA/GH/Flip va cac con so khac de trong set nay de thu nghiem, dua tren set unlimited cua v3
